  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T08:49:34.291667Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T09:13:34.945546Z",
  "totalBlocks": 15,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177519747706da7a",
      "translationZh": "新的智能体运行框架不断涌现。哪些真的能处理 Office 文件？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5d8ef743c35e2cf",
      "translationZh": "办公工作需要一份专门的检查清单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f02352b707913dd5",
      "translationZh": "我目前会问这些问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1618d666cc88eadf",
      "translationZh": "文件模型——智能体是将工作簿、单元格区域、文档和幻灯片理解为对象，还是在编辑不透明的文件字节？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18696a08fb0ca8e5",
      "translationZh": "确定性工作——公式和结构化操作能否在引擎中运行，而不是让模型计算所有内容？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77ef7b732337763f",
      "translationZh": "保真度——交付物是否仍是真正可编辑的 Office 文件？漂亮的 HTML 预览，与一份别人可以继续编辑的 PPTX 并不是一回事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd32e3eeab0e55c9",
      "translationZh": "审查——在源文件被替换之前，你能否看到发生变更的对象、未通过的检查，以及尚未解决的决策事项？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf363c309cfb371e",
      "translationZh": "运行时——同一套底层 API 能否同时在浏览器和无界面的 Node 进程中工作？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9e523d41043bf7b",
      "translationZh": "以下是我认为可信的最小规模对比：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ae843f99f64b738",
      "translationZh": "同一个工作簿。同一个编辑请求。同一个模型和提示词。每种执行框架运行三次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3c3082008bc743c",
      "translationZh": "任务可以很简单：更新一个表格和一个设有数据验证的区域，重新计算公式，然后返回一个可编辑的工作簿，不改动任何其他内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4052af9fdc34c97",
      "translationZh": "然后报告成功次数、意外修改、运行时间、token 数、工具调用次数、成本和已知失败情况。同时公布执行框架的版本以及为这次测试编写的检查项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20605c248d118880",
      "translationZh": "Univer 有开源版本，是应纳入对比的一种 Office 专用执行框架。这项对比应测试其结构化 Office 对象、公式引擎以及浏览器/无头运行路径，而不是把功能列表当成测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c0d7eedd57481ed",
      "translationZh": "在公平的 Office 执行框架对比中，你会纳入哪些内容？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e91609fc856d8cdc",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Sitkin_Marrel 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
